      -> SeqScan huge_transactions AS t  (rows=500000 cost=513ms actual=500000)
      -> SeqScan huge_users AS u  [sorted: u.id]  (rows=100000 cost=93.30ms actual=100000)
Estimated I/O: 35830 transfers, 416 seeks  -> 7743.00 ms
Measured  I/O: 35683 transfers (35050 reads, 633 writes), 384 seeks  -> 7408.30 ms
Buffer pool: 0 hits, 4666 misses, 4410 evictions
Execution: 500000 rows in 756.00 ms

